{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":126,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"e34cfdd6-f2ac-4836-85e3-310ece4f88a9","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190846406,"PostDateInt":1786088408000,"PostDate":"2026-08-07T15:40:08","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"工艺工程师","OrgId":3206726,"Org":"工艺研发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["山东省·青岛市·青岛经济技术开发区"],"Salary":"15K-250K 元/月","Duty":"岗位职责Position Responsibilities：\r\n1、根据客户端或者行业的需求规格要求，在公司自研设备上开发匹配的CVD工艺；\r\n2、制定工艺开发计划， 针对具体的应用和挑战准备实验测试方案和工艺调制建议。\r\n3、负责工艺数据的收集，整理和统计分析， 提交完备的实验报告和相关技术文档；\r\n4、现有工艺方案持续改善，提升工艺品质，良率，产能，COO等；\r\n5、配合工程团队对新研发设备进行工艺测试和CIP方案有效性验证\r\n6、针对客户端出现工艺问题，提出解决方案、提供技术支持；\r\n7、使用、维护、管理薄膜材料的分析设备和仪器；\r\n8、研究跟踪合成碳材料的行业现状和发展趋势，比如工艺方法，材料合成设备等。\r\n\r\n","Require":"\r\n任职要求Qualifications\r\n1、硕士或者博士学历，物理，化学，材料科学，微电子相关专业。硕士学历，3年以上半导体工艺开发相关经验， 博士学历无从业经历要求。 \r\n2、具备良好的英语表达能力，能够流利地进行英语交流;\r\n3、具备良好的团队精神和抗压能力; 有条理且值得信赖，自我驱动和持续学习。","ClassificationOne":"社会招聘","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-07T15:40:08","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"6c88448d-cd4a-4191-9bd5-a5bd0ee43d09","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190846405,"PostDateInt":1786088408000,"PostDate":"2026-08-07T15:40:08","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电气工程师","OrgId":3206729,"Org":"Electrical","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["山东省·青岛市·青岛经济技术开发区"],"Salary":"15K-200K 元/月","Duty":"岗位职责Position Responsibilities：\r\n1、负责人工合成碳材料的工艺设备以及行业配套设备的电气控制系统设计开发工作；\r\n2、基于FEMA规则，对系统进行面向组装/维护/可靠性/安全等方面的综合评估。\r\n3、负责首台设备的组装和调试工作；协同其它专业团队完成CIP方案的测试验证；\r\n4、设计持续改进，负责电气系统工程设计变更的发起和跟踪，处理机械工程相关的ECR/ECN发布工作。\r\n5、协同供应链同事完成供应商开发；负责电工/电子零组件的选型和与供应商的技术交流；支持本地供应商完成供应链国产化相关工作；\r\n6、协同供应链同事完成零组件的询价，提交采购申请，跟踪物料的采购进度。\r\n7、针对客户端出现的电气控制问题，提出解决方案、提供技术支持。\r\n8、按照项目节点，提交相关的设计文档和流程文件。\r\n","Require":"任职要求Qualifications\r\n1、硕士学历，电气工程及其自动化，测控技术与仪器仪表等专业；本科毕业生需要5年以上工作经验，硕士毕业需要3年以上工作经验。\r\n2、能够熟练使用EDA软件辅助完成电气系统设计，诸如Solidworks Electrical，Altium designer等\r\n3、能够独立完成自动化设备电气系统设计；熟悉电气设计规范和低压产品国家、行业标准\r\n4、熟悉欧姆龙、西门子、三菱、松下等PLC系统;\r\n5、熟悉电气标准，熟悉电气布线、电气控制柜设计、各种电气元件的功能技术参数;\r\n6、从事过半导体设备设计、真空设备设计、过程装备设计的候选人，优先考虑录用。","ClassificationOne":"社会招聘","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-07T15:40:08","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"50eb2b18-20bd-4c8b-b202-758c778afe6b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190846404,"PostDateInt":1786088408000,"PostDate":"2026-08-07T15:40:08","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"可靠性工程师","OrgId":3206729,"Org":"Electrical","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["山东省·青岛市·青岛经济技术开发区"],"Salary":"15K-200K 元/月","Duty":"岗位职责：\r\n1、负责产品在开发阶段的可靠性增长试验、可靠性研制试验的方案制定及分析评估；参与产品开发阶段的设计、验证等技术评审；\r\n2、负责产品的零部件可靠性测试标准研究；\r\n3、负责产品可靠性试验技术（如部件的加速寿命试验、故障激发试验等）的研究及运用；\r\n4、负责产品可靠性数据分析、可靠性相关问题的分析与改善；\r\n5、熟悉可靠性试验设备的使用（如Halt、通用环境测试设备等）。\r\n\r\n","Require":"任职要求：\r\n1、本科及以上学历，可靠性、电子、机械等相关专业（可靠性、电子专业优先），3年以上家电/汽车/机电/军工等行业可靠性经验；\r\n2、了解可靠性工程相关理论及可靠性相关标准，熟悉加速寿命测试理论及丰富实践试验者优先；\r\n3、有可靠性增长试验、加速试验等相关经验优先；\r\n4、熟练使用可靠性相关软件（如JMP、webull++、国可工软、Mintab、Reliasoft等）；\r\n5、有良好分析和问题解决能力，良好的团队合作及沟通能力。","ClassificationOne":"社会招聘","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-07T15:40:08","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"9364df0d-0a92-4247-9fba-4c9591fa9894","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190846403,"PostDateInt":1786088408000,"PostDate":"2026-08-07T15:40:08","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"销售部长","OrgId":3206744,"Org":"市场/销售/服务中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["山东省·青岛市·青岛经济技术开发区"],"Salary":"40K-50K 元/月","Duty":"岗位职责：\r\n1. 负责公司市场销售业务的战略制定与执行，开拓市场，监控相关关键节点的落地,对结果负责，维持与现有客户良好的互动和合作关系，推动和协助公司内部保质保量完成各类客户项目的顺利开展；\r\n2. 推广公司产品给潜在客户，了解客户需求和竞争态势，选择适合方案和产品进行深入介绍和交流，商谈合作机会和推动快速建立项目，完成销售任务和计划。\r\n3. 项目进行过程中，协调内部提供客户有效技术和服务支持，对于相关的疑难问题，能主动与内部一起争取相关资源提供支持。\r\n4. 深入了解及研究当地市场，掌握市场动向,带领团队开拓市场，拓展目标市场，达成拓展和业绩目标，与客户采购、研发、财务和管理等部门建立密切联系，确定订单，签署合同，并协调收款和交货等事宜；\r\n5. 对于相关的售后问题，与内部一起协调品质部门和同事进行处理；\r\n6. 快速融入团队,积极配合公司安排.保持对市场的敏锐度,把控项目机会与风险.积极搜寻市场机会,组织执行市场推广活动，协助开发部门和市场部门，了解和反馈客户信息和市场信息，协助相关的客户对接交流等工作；\r\n7. 管理及搭建销售团队，负责分配各成员的销售任务，制定销售计划，监控团队完成度, 打造高绩效团队。\r\n\r\n","Require":"任职要求：\r\n1. 8年以上半导体行业销售或市场工作经验，本科及以上学历，电子、机械、微电子、材料科学等相关专业;\r\n2. 对半导体设备的技术细节和市场有深入的理解，能够与技术团队紧密合作，为客户提供专业的解决方案；\r\n3. 具有良好的客户沟通能力和商务应对能力，能够进行产品和技术演示；\r\n4. 具备团队合作精神，能够带领销售团队达成销售目标，有创建新的业务团队和管理市场区域的能力。","ClassificationOne":"社会招聘","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科及以上","YearsOfWorking":"8年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-07T15:40:08","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"a9854422-6ce6-44db-95a9-5e9f42c8fba2","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190846402,"PostDateInt":1786088408000,"PostDate":"2026-08-07T15:40:08","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机械审图员-上海","OrgId":3207013,"Org":"机械设计一部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市·浦东新区"],"Salary":"8K-15K 元/月","Duty":"1.PDM系统：图纸基础信息审核，包括但不限于图号，版本，关键件标识，技术要求，装配体物料明细表等\r\n2.PLM系统：流程及相关材料审核，包括但不限于装配体物料明细表是否与图纸一致，版本是否一致，关键件信息，采购信息，备件清单更新核对，流程所需材料是否齐全\r\n3.准则对应的图纸审核\r\n4.拆解工程图\r\n5.协助工程师完成领料、退库、返修、清洗、物料管理、物料清单整理等工作","Require":"本科及以上学历，机械设计相关的专业，工作经验1-5年","ClassificationOne":"社会招聘","C